I agree with this line of thought.  I have played many video games over the
years and have gotten very good at some of them, to the point that they were
too easy.  When that happens the logical thing to do is move on to a more
difficult game and start over in the learning, entertainment process.  If all 
games were geared towards the expert the only players would be experts ant the game would eventually die out as no new interest will be generated.



